<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ANGLOVAAL ISSUES FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>ANGLOVAAL ISSUES FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Holdings</p>
<p>Limited on Tuesday advised holders of securities in Anglovaal </p>
<p>Holdings, Anglovaal, Midwits and Target to continue to exercise</p>
<p>caution in dealing in their securities.</p>
<p>This followed a cautionary announcement of May 17 regarding</p>
<p>the reorganisation of the group's mining and mineral interests.</p>
<p>Shareholders were informed that independent advisors were</p>
<p>appointed to examine the terms of the transactions required to</p>
<p>implement the reorganisation.</p>
<p>Anglovaal said on Tuesday the reorganisation process was</p>
<p>complex and was likely to take until December 1996 to complete.</p>
<p>A further announcement was expected by October.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
